#usda 1.0
(
    "USD Museum exhibit stage.imageable.visibility: an invisible lamp, visibility over time held at frames 48 and 50, and a statue drawn by purpose. Red must stay hidden in its outline; blue fills its ghost. Built by src/build.py."
